    "problem": null,
    "final_text": "Three payments were received, each confirmed in a separate email: EUR 5,500 on 08-10, EUR 6,250 on 09-04 and 5.5k euros on 09-05. I counted them as separate payments, so the total is EUR 17,250. The \"5.5k euros\" email could be a repeat of the first payment, but no record says so.\n\nI left out the EUR 7,000 payment that bounced and was not received (r10353). I also left out the \"Amber Kitchen\" payments, which belong to a different client.\n\n{\"answer\": \"EUR 17,250\", \"citations\": [\"r10311\", \"r10351\", \"r10352\"]}",
